  "solution": "<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Khoảng biến thiên của mẫu số liệu là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>31</mn></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>;</mo><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi>Δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br></li><li>Do <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><msub><mi>Δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><msub><mi>Δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></semantics></math> nên mẫu có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>2</mn></semantics></math> giá trị ngoại lệ là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>12</mn></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>15</mn></semantics></math>.</li><li>Số trung bình của mẫu là <div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mi>x</mi><mo accent=\"true\">¯</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>31</mn></mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>128</mn><mn>31</mn></mfrac><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tPhương sai của mẫu là <div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>31</mn></mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>6</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>7</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>12</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>15</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mn>128</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mn>31</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>79</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tĐộ lệch chuẩn của mẫu là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>13</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li></ol>",
